turistic bio-research facility where every button, screen, and machine is physically interactive\u2014no intrusive menus or text-heavy tutorials.\n\n### Key Features\n* **Incubate & Raise 8 Distinct Species:** Select eggs on your main console, nurture your creatures from juveniles into full-grown adults, and watch them thrive inside specialized biome chambers.\n* **Tactile Hand-Feeding:** Operate your multi-food dispenser to generate 5 different types of food tailored to each species' dietary preferences, then feed your creatures directly by hand.\n* **Bio-Resource Economy:** Once your creatures reach adulthood, collect their harvestable bio-resources and process them in the Bio-Extractor to earn credits.\n* **Expand & Upgrade Your Lab:** Spend your credits on the Upgrade Panel to unlock new incubation chambers and expand your facility to support rarer species.\n* **Comfort-First Seated VR:** Designed specifically for relaxed seated play with intuitive Touch controller interactions and zero motion sickness.", "short_description": "Step into a cozy sci-fi bio-lab in VR! Incubate 8 unique species, hand-feed them tailored meals from your dispenser, and harvest bio-resources as they grow into adults. Upgrade your chambers, unlock rare creatures, and enjoy a relaxing, tactile simulation built for seated play."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bnij-8II_bfYE5e8l1V5q9GZT1GODIg3kTkutyOXk70/edit?usp=drive_link", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lagatti", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://lagatty.github.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": 